    <p class="lead">We walk it together and you get a written read on whether the shell can take the program: structural capacity for process and equipment loads, slab and drainage, clear height, service capacity, roof framing, dock configuration and AHJ posture. Anything that does not work comes back with an order-of-magnitude cost to fix it. On site within five business days of access, written read back within five more.</p>
