    <span class="eyebrow">Turnaround and confidence</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Know what a number is worth before you use it.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Every number we hand you says what it was built from and how wrong it is allowed to be. We do not do 48-hour estimates, because nobody can, and a figure without a band on it is a figure you cannot defend to your Owner.</p>

