<!-- ============ NOT VE ============ -->
<section id="not-ve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Who starts it is the whole difference</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">This is not value engineering. You ask, we answer.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Every architect has been through the version where the bids come back high and a contractor arrives with a list. That is not what this is, and the difference is not our manners. It is the mechanism.</p>

    <div class="aap-tablewrap" style="margin-top:28px">
      <table class="aap-tbl aap-cmp">
        <tr><th style="width:17%"></th><th style="width:39%">Value engineering, the way it usually arrives</th><th>Asking us to price something</th></tr>
