    <h2 class="section-title">The first one takes two minutes.</h2>
    <div class="aap-2col" style="margin-top:34px">
      <div>
        <div class="aap-step"><div class="n">1</div><div><h3>Tell us your building types</h3><p>Two minutes on the form below, or reply to any email from us. The Trade Sheet and Market Note arrive that week and again every quarter, built from the projects we have actually delivered.</p></div></div>
        <div class="aap-step"><div class="n">2</div><div><h3>Ask us for exactly what you want</h3><p>A Number Check, a Rapid Range, priced options. You choose which and when, and you can ask as often as it is useful. Everything comes to you first.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="aap-step"><div class="n">3</div><div><h3>Walk the building</h3><p>For adaptive reuse, conversions and additions, and the point at which we are standing in it with you. This is also what puts your firm on the Design Partner Panel.</p></div></div>
        <div class="aap-step"><div class="n">4</div><div><h3>Watch the numbers hold</h3><p>By the time your Owner needs a Contractor you will have seen how we think about cost, how fast we move, and whether the number we gave you in March survived contact with the bid. Introduce us when the work has earned it.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CREDENTIALS ============ -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Who you are recommending</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Why your reputation is safe with us.</h2>
    <p class="lead">An architect's recommendation carries more weight with an Owner than anyone else's on the project, and it costs more if it goes wrong. Here is what stands behind ours.</p>
    <div class="aap-2col" style="margin-top:30px">
      <div class="aap-card"><h3>Owner-led. No junior PM handoff.</h3><p>The person who prices your building is the person who runs it, from design through closeout. That is why our change orders come in under 1%.</p></div>
      <div class="aap-card"><h3>We do not do design, and we do not want to.</h3><p>WCM has no design studio. Every design-build project we deliver is delivered with an architect we hired, which is why a program aimed at architects exists at all.</p></div>
